  "notes": "- 当组内所有节点都无法解析域名时，测速会提示检查网络连接。手动重置 DNS 会等待内核确认刷新完成；可再次测速确认连接是否恢复。\n- 订阅中的代理组引用了缺失或空的节点列表时，YueLink 仍可启动。如果受影响的分流规则没有合适的代理，YueLink 会拦截该规则的请求。刷新订阅可获取更新后的线路配置。\n- 对同一节点同时发起相同的延迟测试时，现在只会发送一次测试请求。取消较早的测试后，较新的测速结果仍会保留。\n- 通过 HTTPS 地址测试 Hysteria 2 节点时，如果测试失败前目标网站已经开始响应，诊断报告现在可以标明这一点。\n- 帮助中心的 Telegram 账号绑定和小程序指南新增了机器人直达链接。\n",
  "notesEn": "- When every node in a group fails DNS resolution, the speed test now identifies that failure. A manual DNS reset waits for the core to confirm the refresh. Test the connection again to check whether it has recovered.\n- Subscriptions can now start when a proxy group references a missing or empty node list. If an affected route has no suitable proxy, YueLink blocks its requests. Refresh the subscription to get updated routes.\n- Running identical latency checks on a node at the same time now uses a single request. Cancelling an older check preserves the newer result.\n- For Hysteria 2 latency checks that use HTTPS, diagnostic reports can now identify a failure after the destination started to respond.\n- The Help center now links directly to the Telegram bot in the account linking and Mini App guides.\n",
  "sourceCommit": "b66825002fd1cd0310e7fdb00b13ad0eac335e5c",
